    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "// 准备LLM Prompt用于查询增强 - 采用末尾keywords标签格式\nconst originalQuestion = $json.escaped_text;\n\nconst prompt = `你是一个金融数据查询预处理助手。请分析用户问题，在末尾添加keywords标签来增强检索精准度。\n\n## 输出格式\n保留原问题完整不变，在末尾添加 keywords: [关键词1, 关键词2, ...]\n\n## 完整关键词库（16个Factsheet Section Titles + 变体）\n\n1. **Investment objective** - 投资目标\n   变体: investment goal, fund objective\n\n2. **Performance since launch** - 成立以来表现\n   变体: historical performance, cumulative return\n\n3. **Performance update** - 业绩更新\n   变体: performance, return, YTD, monthly return\n\n4. **NAVs & codes** - 净值和代码\n   变体: NAV, fund code, ISIN, Bloomberg code\n\n5. **Dividend information** - 股息信息\n   变体: dividend, payout, yield, distribution, income\n\n6. **Top holdings - equities** - 股票持仓\n   变体: top holdings, equities, stock holdings, equity holdings\n\n7. **Top holdings - fixed income** - 债券持仓\n   变体: top holdings, fixed income, bond holdings, debt holdings\n\n8. **Monthly performance** - 月度表现\n   变体: monthly return, monthly performance table\n\n9. **Portfolio characteristics** - 组合特征\n   变体: portfolio, characteristics, yield, duration\n\n10. **Asset type by geography** - 地区配置\n    变体: asset allocation, geography, country allocation, regional\n\n11. **Asset type by sector** - 行业配置\n    变体: asset allocation, sector, industry allocation\n\n12. **Credit ratings** - 信用评级\n    变体: credit rating, rating distribution, AAA, AA, BBB\n\n13. **Fund facts** - 基金概况\n    变体: fund information, fund details, AUM, inception date\n\n14. **Fee structure** - 费用结构\n    变体: fee, management fee, subscription fee, expense ratio\n\n15. **Senior investment staff** - 投资团队\n    变体: fund manager, investment team, portfolio manager\n\n16. **Key fund awards** - 基金奖项\n    变体: awards, recognition, fund awards\n\n## 增强规则\n\n1. 识别问题涉及的section类别\n2. 在末尾添加 keywords: [核心词, 变体词1, 变体词2, ...]\n3. 包含2-5个最相关的关键词\n4. 原问题保持完全不变\n\n## 示例\n\n输入: \"What are top holdings of Asian Income Fund from January to September 2025?\"\n输出: \"What are top holdings of Asian Income Fund from January to September 2025? keywords: [top holdings, equities, fixed income, stock holdings, bond holdings]\"\n\n输入: \"What is the dividend information of High Dividend Fund?\"\n输出: \"What is the dividend information of High Dividend Fund? keywords: [dividend information, dividend, payout, yield, distribution]\"\n\n输入: \"Show me the performance of Asian Income Fund Q1 2025\"\n输出: \"Show me the performance of Asian Income Fund Q1 2025? keywords: [performance update, monthly performance, return, YTD]\"\n\n输入: \"惠理亚洲收益基金的资产配置是什么？\"\n输出: \"惠理亚洲收益基金的资产配置是什么？ keywords: [asset type by geography, asset type by sector, asset allocation, geography, sector]\"\n\n输入: \"What is the credit rating distribution?\"\n输出: \"What is the credit rating distribution? keywords: [credit ratings, rating distribution, AAA, AA, BBB]\"\n\n输入: \"Compare fee structures between funds\"\n输出: \"Compare fee structures between funds? keywords: [fee structure, management fee, expense ratio, fee]\"\n\n## 不要做的事\n- 不要修改原问题的任何部分\n- 不要展开时间范围\n- 不要添加与问题无关的关键词\n\n## 用户问题\n${originalQuestion}\n\n## 输出（原问题 + keywords标签，不要解释）`;\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    original_question: originalQuestion,\n    prompt: prompt\n  }\n};"
      },
